msgid ""
"draft: still building the batch, members can be added or removed. confirmed:"
" locked from member edits, ready to post. posted: every member payment has "
"been posted; cash has moved. cancelled: terminal, members released back to "
"the open pool."
msgstr ""
"draft: el lote aún se está construyendo, se pueden añadir o quitar miembros."
" confirmed: bloqueado frente a ediciones de miembros, listo para "
"contabilizar. posted: se ha contabilizado cada pago de miembro; el efectivo "
"se ha movido. cancelled: terminal, los miembros vuelven al pool abierto."

